OL,3,ARussia says it helped to repel Niger
OL,4,Aattempted coup
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussia has said its forces helped to
OL,7,Frepel Saturday's attempted coup in
OL,8,FNiger.
OL,10,FExplosions and gunfire rang out across
OL,11,Fcapital, Niamey, early in the morning,
OL,12,Fincluding at a key military airbase and
OL,13,Fthe presidential palace.
OL,15,FHours later, Niger's authorities said
OL,16,Fthe rebellion had been contained.
OL,18,FNigerien forces had repelled the attack
OL,19,F"with the assistance of servicemen of
OL,20,Fthe African Corps of the Russian
OL,21,FMinistry of Defence", the foreign
OL,22,Fministry in Moscow said on Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
